<title>USA: Sequa says to buy W.R.Grace unit.</title>
<headline>Sequa says to buy W.R.Grace unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sequa Corp said Monday it reached agreement to buy of W.R. Grace &amp; Co's TEC Systems unit for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Sequa said it expects the deal to close in the third quarter. TEC makes dryers and environmental control equipment for paper, printing and other industrial uses.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
